git-for-kids
============

This project builds on open source work. Full credit and thanks:

1. learnGitBranching -- https://github.com/pcottle/learnGitBranching
   Copyright (c) 2012-2025 Peter Cottle
   Licensed under the MIT License.

   We use its level definitions (start trees, goal trees, official solution
   commands, hints and lesson dialogs) for all 36 base levels, imported by
   scripts/import-levels.mjs into data/levels.json. The git engine in this
   repo is an independent TypeScript implementation, verified against those
   original levels' solution commands for behavioral parity.

   The MIT license text is reproduced in full in licenses/learnGitBranching-MIT.txt

